{"id":"verschwiegen","lemma":"verschwiegen","pos":"adj","rank":4622,"glosses":["reticent, tight-lipped, quiet","secretive","discreet"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/28/De-verschwiegen.ogg/De-verschwiegen.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"verschwiegener","superlative":"am verschwiegensten"},"examples":[{"text":"Hast du mir etwas verschwiegen?","en":"Is there something you haven't told me?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"something"},null]},{"text":"Tom ist verschwiegen, nicht wahr?","en":"Tom is discreet, isn't he?","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"right?"]]},{"text":"Hast du Kinder, die du mir verschwiegen hast?","en":"Do you have any children you haven't told me about?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"kid","l":"Kind"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Tom war immer verschwiegen.","en":"Tom was always secretive.","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"at all times without…"},null]},{"text":"Hättest du dir weniger Sorgen gemacht, wenn ich dir verschwiegen hätte, wohin ich wollte?","en":"Would you have been any less worried if I hadn't told you where I was going?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"less"},{"g":"to take care of"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"if / when"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"where to, whither"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"}]}]}